{"name": "glm45", "yaml_preview": "# GLM 4.5 — cross-protocol cloud baseline\n# Canonical cross-protocol dataset: HTTP rerun post-bugfix here, MCP/A2A\n# reused from the original cross-protocol run (those protocols never had\n# the agent-loop bug, no rerun needed).\n# The LLM tracks state (productId, orderId) autonomously across all turns.\n\nname: glm45\ndescription: >\n  GLM 4.5 (Zhipu AI) cross-protocol baseline. Cloud model via z.ai API.\n  Both think and nothink modes, same rates, same seed across protocols.\n  Full per-turn JSONL traces (--trace-llm).\ncreated: 2026-04-13\ngeneration: cross_protocol_baseline\n\n# ── Model ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nmodel:\n  id: glm-4.5\n  tag: glm45\n  provider: zhipuai\n  base_url: https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4\n  runtime: cloud (z.ai API)\n  has_thinking: true\n  sleep_between_rates_s: 5\n  notes: >\n    Commercial cloud — no control over quantization/GPU.\n\n# ── Per-request parameters ───────────────────────────────────────────────────\nper_request_params:\n  temperature: 0.2\n  seed: 2026\n  thinking: [true, false]       # Both reasoning modes\n\ntrace: true                     # Full per-turn JSONL traces\n\n# ── Protocols ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# HTTP run here; MCP/A2A reused from the original cross-protocol run.\nprotocols: [http]\n\n# ── Rate plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfailure_rates: [0.0, 0.01, 0.02, 0.03, 0.05, 0.10, 0.15, 0.20, 0.25, 0.30]\nexperiments_per_rate: 600  # progressive: 50 -> 100 -> 200 -> 500 -> 600 (top-up 2026-05-14)\n\n# ── Totals ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# 3 protocols × 2 thinking modes × 2 agents (pb/nopb) × 10 rates × 600/rate = 72,000\ntotal_experiments: 72000\n\n# ── Infrastructure ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nseed: 2026\nsimulate_delays: false\n\n# ── Expected analysis ───────────────